('105-4301-067','105-4301',67,'single_choice',2,'Vincent has a 10-minute quarrel with Dan before he goes to work. On Vincent’s way to work, a drunk driver hits him. Vincent sues Dan for his injuries and claims that Dan negligently delays his schedule. Dan may argue that there is no between Vincent’s injuries and Dan’s acts.','causation','casualty','link','collision',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],12,12,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
